# Runtime data (DB backups, app/tunnel/watchdog logs, images) lives OUTSIDE the
# repo in the machine data dir C:\economizai-data (override: ECONOMIZAI_DATA_ROOT).
# Kept off the project tree so it's never committed or OneDrive-synced. The
# entries below are defensive: catch stray legacy files if an old script runs.
